# TourTrip.app Website Development Standards

## Website Architecture & System Integration

### Multi-System Compatibility
- **Backend Integration**: Seamless API communication with Node.js microservices; unified error handling; consistent data models.
- **Mobile App Alignment**: Shared design system; consistent user flows; cross-platform feature parity.
- **Admin Dashboard**: Role-based access; operator management; analytics integration; content management.
- **External Services**: Third-party integrations (maps, payments, communication); fallback strategies; cost optimization.

### Website-Specific Technology Stack
- **Core Framework**: Next.js 14+ with App Router; React 18 Server Components; TypeScript strict mode.
- **Styling & UI**: Tailwind CSS + Radix UI + shadcn/ui; responsive design system; theme consistency.
- **State Management**: Server-first approach; TanStack Query for API state; Zustand for complex client state.
- **Authentication**: NextAuth.js with multiple providers; session management; role-based access control.
- **Database Layer**: Direct PostgreSQL access for admin features; Redis for caching; search with Elasticsearch.

