## Backend System Integration Patterns

### API Communication Standards
```typescript
// Unified API client configuration
interface TourTripAPIClient {
  // User Management Service
  users: {
    authenticate: (credentials: LoginCredentials) => Promise<AuthResponse>;
    register: (userData: UserRegistration) => Promise<UserProfile>;
    getProfile: (userId: string) => Promise<UserProfile>;
    updateProfile: (userId: string, data: ProfileUpdate) => Promise<UserProfile>;
  };
  
  // Tour Service
  tours: {
    search: (params: TourSearchParams) => Promise<TourSearchResult>;
    getDetails: (tourId: string) => Promise<TourDetails>;
    getAvailability: (tourId: string, dateRange: DateRange) => Promise<AvailabilityData>;
    getPricing: (tourId: string, participants: number, date: string) => Promise<PricingData>;
  };
  
  // Booking Service
  bookings: {
    create: (bookingData: BookingRequest) => Promise<BookingResponse>;
    get: (bookingId: string) => Promise<BookingDetails>;
    update: (bookingId: string, updates: BookingUpdate) => Promise<BookingDetails>;
    cancel: (bookingId: string, reason: string) => Promise<CancellationResult>;
    getUserBookings: (userId: string) => Promise<BookingHistory>;
  };
  
  // Payment Service
  payments: {
    createPaymentIntent: (amount: number, currency: string) => Promise<PaymentIntent>;
    processPayment: (paymentData: PaymentRequest) => Promise<PaymentResult>;
    getPaymentStatus: (paymentId: string) => Promise<PaymentStatus>;
    initiateRefund: (paymentId: string, amount?: number) => Promise<RefundResult>;
  };
  
  // Location Service
  locations: {
    search: (query: string) => Promise<LocationSearchResult>;
    getDetails: (locationId: string) => Promise<LocationDetails>;
    getNearbyTours: (coordinates: Coordinates, radius: number) => Promise<Tour[]>;
    getWeather: (locationId: string) => Promise<WeatherData>;
  };
}
```

### Error Handling & Resilience
```typescript
// Unified error handling across all API calls
class TourTripAPIError extends Error {
  constructor(
    public statusCode: number,
    public errorCode: string,
    public userMessage: string,
    public technicalDetails?: any
  ) {
    super(userMessage);
    this.name = 'TourTripAPIError';
  }
}

// Circuit breaker pattern for external services
interface CircuitBreakerConfig {
  failureThreshold: number;
  timeout: number;
  resetTimeout: number;
  monitoringPeriod: number;
}

// Retry policy with exponential backoff
interface RetryPolicy {
  maxRetries: number;
  baseDelay: number;
  maxDelay: number;
  retryableStatusCodes: number[];
}
```

## Website-Specific Security Implementation

### Authentication & Session Management
- **Multi-Provider Auth**: Email/password; Google; Facebook; Apple; Turkish providers (e-Devlet).
- **Session Security**: HttpOnly cookies; CSRF protection; session rotation; concurrent session limits.
- **Role-Based Access**: User; Operator; Admin; Support; Super Admin hierarchies.
- **Account Security**: Password policies; 2FA for operators; account lockout; suspicious activity detection.

### Payment Security Integration
- **PCI DSS Compliance**: No card data storage; tokenization; secure transmission; audit logging.
- **Turkish Payment Integration**: iyzico; Garanti BBVA; İş Bankası; local bank integrations.
- **International Payments**: Stripe; PayPal; Apple Pay; Google Pay; multi-currency support.
- **Fraud Prevention**: Velocity checks; geolocation validation; risk scoring; manual review thresholds.

### Data Protection & Privacy
- **KVKK Compliance**: Turkish data protection law; explicit consent; data localization; breach notification.
- **GDPR Implementation**: EU user rights; data portability; right to be forgotten; privacy by design.
- **Cookie Management**: Consent banners; preference centers; analytics opt-out; essential vs optional cookies.
- **Content Security**: Image virus scanning; user-generated content moderation; XSS prevention; input sanitization.

## Performance & Optimization Strategies

### Website Performance Requirements
- **Core Web Vitals**: LCP <2.5s; FID <100ms; CLS <0.1; INP <200ms.
- **Mobile Performance**: 3G network optimization; lazy loading; image compression; critical resource prioritization.
- **SEO Optimization**: Server-side rendering; meta tags; structured data; sitemap generation; page speed optimization.
- **Accessibility**: WCAG 2.1 AA compliance; keyboard navigation; screen reader support; color contrast validation.

### Caching & CDN Strategy
```typescript
// Multi-level caching for website performance
interface WebsiteCacheStrategy {
  // Static assets (long-term caching)
  staticAssets: {
    images: '1 year';
    css: '1 year';
    js: '1 year';
    fonts: '1 year';
  };
  
  // Dynamic content caching
  pages: {
    homepage: '1 hour';
    tourPages: '30 minutes';
    searchResults: '5 minutes';
    userDashboard: 'no-cache';
  };
  
  // API response caching
  apiResponses: {
    tourDetails: '1 hour';
    locations: '6 hours';
    availability: '2 minutes';
    pricing: '1 minute';
    userProfile: 'session';
  };
  
  // CDN configuration
  cdn: {
    provider: 'CloudFront | Cloudflare';
    regions: ['EU', 'US', 'TR', 'AS'];
    compressionEnabled: true;
    httpPushEnabled: true;
  };
}
```

