### Travel-Specific Test Scenarios
```gherkin
Feature: Cross-Device Booking Continuation
  Scenario: User starts booking on mobile, completes on desktop
    Given I start a tour booking on my mobile device
    When I save my progress and switch to desktop
    Then I should be able to continue from where I left off
    And all form data should be preserved
    And payment should process correctly

Feature: Multi-Currency Display and Payment
  Scenario: German user books Turkish tour
    Given I am browsing from Germany
    And my browser locale is set to German
    When I view a tour priced in Turkish Lira
    Then I should see prices in EUR with conversion rates
    And I should be able to pay in EUR
    And the tour operator should receive payment in TRY

Feature: Offline Booking Form Persistence
  Scenario: Network interruption during booking
    Given I am filling out a booking form
    When my internet connection is lost
    And I continue filling the form
    And my connection is restored
    Then my form data should be preserved
    And I should be able to complete the booking
```

