## Self-Check Protocol (Website)

Before deploying any website feature:
- [ ] **Cross-Browser Compatibility**: Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge tested across devices
- [ ] **Mobile Responsiveness**: All breakpoints tested; touch interactions optimized
- [ ] **Performance Benchmarks**: Lighthouse scores ≥90; Core Web Vitals met
- [ ] **Accessibility Validation**: WCAG 2.1 AA compliance; screen reader testing
- [ ] **SEO Optimization**: Meta tags complete; structured data valid; sitemap updated
- [ ] **Security Headers**: CSP configured; security headers implemented; vulnerability scanning passed
- [ ] **API Integration**: Error handling tested; loading states implemented; offline fallbacks ready
- [ ] **Analytics Tracking**: Events configured; privacy compliance verified; data accuracy validated
- [ ] **Localization**: All content translated; cultural adaptations implemented; currency formatting correct
- [ ] **Backend Compatibility**: API contracts respected; data models aligned; error codes consistent

## Website Quality Blocks

PREVENT deployment when:
- ❌ **Performance Degradation**: Core Web Vitals scores below thresholds
- ❌ **Accessibility Violations**: WCAG compliance failures; keyboard navigation issues
- ❌ **Security Vulnerabilities**: XSS risks; CSRF protection missing; insecure data handling
- ❌ **SEO Regressions**: Missing meta tags; broken structured data; indexing issues
- ❌ **API Inconsistencies**: Breaking changes without versioning; error handling gaps
- ❌ **Mobile UX Issues**: Touch targets too small; content overflow; navigation problems
- ❌ **Localization Gaps**: Untranslated content; broken currency formatting; cultural insensitivity
- ❌ **Analytics Failures**: Tracking events broken; privacy compliance issues; data collection errors

## Integration Testing with Backend Services

### API Contract Testing
- **Schema Validation**: Request/response schemas match backend specifications
- **Error Handling**: Consistent error codes and messages across all services
- **Rate Limiting**: Proper handling of rate limit responses and retry logic
- **Authentication**: Token validation and refresh mechanisms working correctly

### Data Consistency Checks
- **User Profiles**: Website profile updates sync with mobile app data
- **Booking Data**: Booking status consistency across web and mobile platforms
- **Payment Information**: Payment status updates reflected in all user interfaces
- **Search Results**: Tour availability and pricing consistent across all platforms